# HSTS + keamanan dasar (memaksa HTTPS di level browser, melengkapi canonical).
# Redirect domain-level http->https dan www->apex ditangani di dashboard Cloudflare
# (Always Use HTTPS + Redirect Rules), karena aset statis Workers tidak mendukung
# redirect absolute di file ini.
/*
	Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
	X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
	X-Frame-Options: DENY
	Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
